{"id":642610,"shortDescription":"Un sereno juego de exploración en primera persona desarrollado en un mundo que crece a tu alrededor. Recorre un ecosistema psicodélico y colorido de abundante flora, atronadoras cascadas, pujantes montañas, monolitos resplandecientes y elegantes criaturas. De una a tres horas para huir del trabajo, de la ansiedad y del estrés.","developers":["Hollow Tree Games"],"publishers":["Plug In Digital"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Remote Play en TV","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"5 JUN 2018","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1781884837","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642610/ss_bf125facfc449a65ae8d374b7c6bedaaaefb882e.600x338.jpg?t=1781884837","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642610/ss_bf125facfc449a65ae8d374b7c6bedaaaefb882e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781884837"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642610/ss_3a020fbd7225c00a668bcefc2bc784fd1a7255d8.600x338.jpg?t=1781884837","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642610/ss_3a020fbd7225c00a668bcefc2bc784fd1a7255d8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781884837"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642610/ss_956582d85f6326d74540e21a08958004b1747485.600x338.jpg?t=1781884837","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642610/ss_956582d85f6326d74540e21a08958004b1747485.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781884837"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642610/ss_c4a6b16be2611ac75b97b9e66eea2a7bd25f8bee.600x338.jpg?t=1781884837","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642610/ss_c4a6b16be2611ac75b97b9e66eea2a7bd25f8bee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781884837"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item